---
// The Tiger Lake host from Table I of the paper, and the two thread placements
// Sections 5.2 and 5.3 compare. Geometry is generated on a fixed grid and
// checked for wire and label clearance; see scripts/ notes in AGENTS.md.
---

<figure class="anim" data-cpu>
